        <p>The Spanish consulates don't reject applications because people aren't eligible. They reject applications because of careless, preventable mistakes. Nearly 9 out of 10 rejections trace back to one thing: an applicant didn't follow the checklist closely enough or didn't understand a specific requirement.</p>
